msgctxt "92"
msgid "Gotta say, you look good! For a while there, I thought you were done for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Heh, I got Doc Emoto to thank for that. He's a real angel, that guy. Not "
"many doctors would bother to treat a penniless bum like myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Yeah. I'm surprised he can make ends meet doin' business like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I heard he's got some rich guy supporting him. He helps out on the money "
"end, so the doc can treat the people of Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"That's amazin'. I guess there are still some decent people left in the "
"world, huh?"
msgstr ""

